365 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(As a means to meet OAMa's fundraising and economic viability goals, we provide consulting services and project execution related to ornithological research, professional training, promotion of ecotourism, and environmental education.)/E(As a means to meet OAMa's fundraising and economic viability goals, we provide consulting services and project execution related to ornithological research, professional training, promotion of ecotourism, and environmental education.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

366 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(During 2024, we were in the third year of providing Environmental Education services to the Pro-Management Association of the Waters of the Hydrographic Basin of the Para\355ba do Sul River \(AGEVAP\). We were hired to lead the Environmental Education and Socio-Environmental Development actions of the \(Re\)Forest, Water and Carbon project, an extension of the Water and Forest Producers Program \(PAF\) \205 Guandu \(RJ\). Among the planned actions were the preparation and execution of short courses on Forests and Climate Change with the school community, training courses for rural producers in Agricultural Good Practices and Reforestation, training events for socioeconomic and environmental development, and communication and dissemination of the project and its themes of action with the public.)/E(During 2024, we were in the third year of providing Environmental Education services to the Pro-Management Association of the Waters of the Hydrographic Basin of the Para\355ba do Sul River \(AGEVAP\). We were hired to lead the Environmental Education and Socio-Environmental Development actions of the \(Re\)Forest, Water and Carbon project, an extension of the Water and Forest Producers Program \(PAF\) \205 Guandu \(RJ\). Among the planned actions were the preparation and execution of short courses on Forests and Climate Change with the school community, training courses for rural producers in Agricultural Good Practices and Reforestation, training events for socioeconomic and environmental development, and communication and dissemination of the project and its themes of action with the public.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

367 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(The project is carried out by AGEVAP with funding from the Guandu, Guarda and Guandu-Mirim River Basins Committee \(Guandu Committee\) and Petrobras, through the Petrobras Socio-environmental program.)/E(The project is carried out by AGEVAP with funding from the Guandu, Guarda and Guandu-Mirim River Basins Committee \(Guandu Committee\) and Petrobras, through the Petrobras Socio-environmental program.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

