418 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(We would like to give a special shout-out to the 2024 OAMa patrons. C.J. and Carol Ralph have been part of OAMa's history since its very beginning. In addition to being supporters, they were inspiration and advisors for the creation and structuring of the organization. In 2024, they donated OAMa's first institutional car! This car, a Pajero TR4 4x4, will provide access to monitoring and research data collection areas. The vehicle will also allow us to carry out numerous other institutional, educational and science communication activities. Thank you, Carol and C.J. We don't have wings yet, but now we have wheels, and they will take us wherever we need to go.)/E(We would like to give a special shout-out to the 2024 OAMa patrons. C.J. and Carol Ralph have been part of OAMa's history since its very beginning. In addition to being supporters, they were inspiration and advisors for the creation and structuring of the organization. In 2024, they donated OAMa's first institutional car! This car, a Pajero TR4 4x4, will provide access to monitoring and research data collection areas. The vehicle will also allow us to carry out numerous other institutional, educational and science communication activities. Thank you, Carol and C.J. We don't have wings yet, but now we have wheels, and they will take us wherever we need to go.)/Pg 26 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

